    metaTitle: 'Jacek Janczura — AI Architect & Interim Head of AI',
    metaDescription:
      "I've shipped production AI for Norges Bank, APG (€500B+ AUM) and Boehringer Ingelheim's R&D (top-20 global pharma) — places that audit every line. I de-risk inherited stacks, put AI where it earns its keep, close the compliance gaps, and leave your team running it without me.",
    eyebrow: 'AI Architect · Interim Head of AI',
    heroTitle:
      'A central bank trusted my code.\n<span class="hero-title-em">Your inherited stack can too.</span>',
    tierLine:
      'Norges Bank · APG (€500B+ AUM) · Boehringer Ingelheim R&D (top-20 global pharma) · certified AI provider for Bosch',
