      "I've shipped production AI for Norges Bank, APG — a €500B+ Dutch pension fund — and Boehringer Ingelheim's R&D — one of the world's top 20 pharma companies — places that audit every line. I bring that same standard into companies mid-change: de-risk the legacy system, put AI where it earns its keep, close the compliance gaps, and leave your team able to run the whole thing without me.",
